---
const foundations = ['Sales', 'Sales management', 'Ownership', 'Military service'];
const investments = ['Cloud', 'Security', 'Architecture', 'Technical instruction'];
---

<figure class="csm" aria-labelledby="csm-title" aria-describedby="csm-caption">
  <div class="csm-field" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <header class="csm-header">
    <span class="csm-eyebrow">The same career bet · opposite proof problem</span>
    <h3 id="csm-title">I spent six years building the middle.</h3>
  </header>

  <div class="csm-map">
    <section class="csm-era csm-era--start">
      <div class="csm-year">2020</div>
      <p class="csm-question">Can the sales guy do the technical work?</p>
      <div class="csm-chips">
        {foundations.map((item) => <span>{item}</span>)}
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="csm-rail" aria-label="Six years of deliberate technical development">
      <span class="csm-rail-label">Six-year technical investment</span>
      <div class="csm-track">
        <span class="csm-line"></span>
        <span class="csm-node csm-node--one"></span>
        <span class="csm-node csm-node--two"></span>
        <span class="csm-node csm-node--three"></span>
        <span class="csm-arrow"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="csm-investments">
        {investments.map((item) => <span>{item}</span>)}
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="csm-era csm-era--now">
      <div class="csm-year">2026</div>
      <p class="csm-question">Can the technical guy lead the commercial work?</p>
      <div class="csm-outcome">
        <span class="csm-outcome-kicker">The role I planned for</span>
        <strong>Commercial leadership<br />+ technical judgment</strong>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="csm-caption">
    The plan did not reverse. The evidence changed. My resume needs to show the foundation, the investment, and the role they were meant to unlock.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .csm {
    container-type: inline-size;
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    scroll-margin-top: 6rem;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(165, 184, 238, 0.22);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: clamp(1.35rem, 0.85rem + 2.4cqw, 2.7rem);
    color: #fbfaf6;
    background:
      radial-gradient(130% 95% at 12% -10%, rgba(52, 186, 255, 0.24), transparent 58%),
      radial-gradient(100% 90% at 92% 110%, rgba(244, 196, 48, 0.15), transparent 56%),
      linear-gradient(150deg, #0e2a52 0%, #0b2344 55%, #081a36 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 26px 70px rgba(6, 23, 31, 0.32);
  }

  .csm-field {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: -1;
    inset: 0;
    opacity: 0.32;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(165, 184, 238, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(165, 184, 238, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 34px 34px;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, #000 24%, #000 80%, transparent);
  }

  .csm-header {
    max-width: 46rem;
    margin-bottom: clamp(1.6rem, 1rem + 2.5cqw, 3rem);
  }

  .csm-eyebrow,
  .csm-outcome-kicker {
    display: block;
    color: #34baff;
    font-size: clamp(0.65rem, 0.58rem + 0.3cqw, 0.78rem);
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .csm h3 {
    margin: 0.45rem 0 0;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: 'Lora', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 1rem + 2.2cqw, 2.65rem);
    line-height: 1.06;
  }

  .csm-map {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.92fr) minmax(13rem, 1.35fr) minmax(0, 0.92fr);
    gap: clamp(1rem, 0.5rem + 2cqw, 2.2rem);
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .csm-era {
    display: flex;
    min-width: 0;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 0.72rem + 1.2cqw, 1.5rem);
    border: 1px solid rgba(165, 184, 238, 0.24);
    background: rgba(6, 23, 31, 0.52);
  }

  .csm-era--now {
    border-color: rgba(244, 196, 48, 0.42);
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(244, 196, 48, 0.09), rgba(6, 23, 31, 0.58));
  }

  .csm-year {
    color: #a5b8ee;
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'Cascadia Code', monospace;
    font-size: clamp(0.72rem, 0.66rem + 0.25cqw, 0.86rem);
    font-weight: 850;
  }

  .csm-question {
    min-height: 4.2em;
    margin: 0.65rem 0 1.2rem;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 0.82rem + 0.7cqw, 1.28rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.28;
  }

  .csm-chips,
  .csm-investments {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.42rem;
  }

  .csm-chips span,
  .csm-investments span {
    border: 1px solid rgba(165, 184, 238, 0.25);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.33rem 0.58rem;
    color: #dce7f7;
    background: rgba(165, 184, 238, 0.09);
    font-size: clamp(0.66rem, 0.61rem + 0.2cqw, 0.78rem);
    font-weight: 750;
  }

  .csm-rail {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    min-height: 13rem;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 2.25rem 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .csm-rail-label {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.25rem;
    left: 50%;
    width: 100%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    color: #e2f9d9;
    font-size: clamp(0.7rem, 0.62rem + 0.28cqw, 0.82rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .csm-line {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(165, 184, 238, 0.2);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .csm-track {
    position: relative;
  }

  .csm-line::after {
    position: absolute;
    content: '';
    inset: 0;
    transform-origin: left;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #008fd3, #34baff 58%, #f4c430);
    box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(52, 186, 255, 0.75);
    animation: csm-charge 2.4s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both;
  }

  .csm-node {
    position: absolute;
    top: 2px;
    width: 0.72rem;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(45deg);
    border: 2px solid #34baff;
    background: #0b2344;
    box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(52, 186, 255, 0.65);
  }

  .csm-node--one { left: 22%; }
  .csm-node--two { left: 50%; }
  .csm-node--three { left: 78%; border-color: #f4c430; }

  .csm-arrow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 2px;
    right: -0.05rem;
    width: 0.8rem;
    height: 0.8rem;
    transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(45deg);
    border-top: 3px solid #f4c430;
    border-right: 3px solid #f4c430;
  }

  .csm-investments {
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 1.35rem;
  }

  .csm-investments span {
    border-color: rgba(52, 186, 255, 0.3);
    color: #e8f7ff;
    background: rgba(0, 143, 211, 0.14);
  }

  .csm-outcome {
    margin-top: auto;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(244, 196, 48, 0.32);
    padding-top: 1rem;
  }

  .csm-outcome-kicker { color: #f4c430; }

  .csm-outcome strong {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.45rem;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(0.88rem, 0.76rem + 0.45cqw, 1.06rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .csm figcaption {
    margin-top: clamp(1.35rem, 0.85rem + 1.6cqw, 2rem);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(165, 184, 238, 0.18);
    padding-top: 1rem;
    color: #d8e4f4;
    font-size: clamp(0.78rem, 0.7rem + 0.28cqw, 0.94rem);
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  @keyframes csm-charge {
    from { transform: scaleX(0); opacity: 0.45; }
    to { transform: scaleX(1); opacity: 1; }
  }

  @container (max-width: 600px) {
    .csm-map { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .csm-question { min-height: 0; }
    .csm-rail {
      min-height: 10rem;
      padding-inline: 0.5rem;
    }
    .csm-arrow { right: 0.45rem; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .csm-line::after { animation: none; }
  }
</style>